Derived files carry a "Derived from mixpanel_flutter_session_replay" header
that says what was changed. In summary: the screenshot capture, on-device
masking (text fields, images, text, the mask/unmask widgets), touch sampling,
capture scheduling and the native JPEG encoders were forked; Mixpanel's
upload, remote settings, event triggers, analytics registration, wireframes,
web support and SQLite queue were removed and replaced by ReplayIQ's own
Recording API v1 transport.
